lso the one where marketing claims most often outrun reality. A little knowledge before you spend saves a lot of frustration.</p></div>\n<nav class=\"toc\" aria-label=\"Table of contents\"><p class=\"toc-h\">Contents</p><ul><li><a href=\"#the-format-matters-more-than-the-resolution-1\">The format matters more than the resolution</a></li><li><a href=\"#compatibility-is-where-sites-overpromise-2\">Compatibility is where sites overpromise</a></li><li><a href=\"#standalone-versus-tethered-3\">Standalone versus tethered</a></li><li><a href=\"#what-our-vr-entries-record-4\">What our VR entries record</a></li><li><a href=\"#more-vr-guides-5\">More VR guides</a></li></ul></nav>\n<div class=\"article-meta\"><span>Dark-Ero editorial</span><span>2026-09-30</span></div>\n<article class=\"prose\">\n    <p style=\"font-size:18px;color:var(--text)\">The format is genuinely different. The compatibility claims are genuinely unreliable. Read this first.</p>\n    <p>VR is the one adult format where the technology materially changes the experience, and also the one where marketing claims most often outrun reality. A little knowledge before you spend saves a lot of frustration.</p><h2 id=\"the-format-matters-more-than-the-resolution-1\">The format matters more than the resolution</h2><p>VR video is filmed and encoded differently from flat video, and the important spec is not just resolution but how the footage is projected — 180 or 360 degrees, and how many frames. A site advertising '8K' means little if the projection is wrong for your headset.</p><h2 id=\"compatibility-is-where-sites-overpromise-2\">Compatibility is where sites overpromise</h2><p>Most VR sites claim to support every headset. In practice, playback quality varies enormously between devices, and the app or player a site provides is often the deciding factor. The only reliable test is a site's own free sample on your actual headset.</p><div class=\"callout\"><p>Always play a site&#x27;s free VR sample on your own headset before subscribing. Compatibility claims are marketing; the sample is the truth.</p></div><h2 id=\"standalone-versus-tethered-3\">Standalone versus tethered</h2><p>Standalone headsets and PC-tethered setups handle VR video differently, and a site that runs beautifully on one can stutter on the other. If a site lists supported devices specifically rather than claiming 'all headsets', that specificity is a good sign.</p><h2 id=\"what-our-vr-entries-record-4\">What our VR entries record</h2><p>Every VR listing notes which headsets the site genuinely supports and whether a free sample exists, because those two facts decide whether the subscription is worth anything to you.</p>\n    <div class=\"callout safe\"><p>Browsing this topic? See the <a href=\"/category/vr/\">VR</a> section of the directory for hand-checked sites.</p></div>\n    <hr class=\"divider\" style=\"margin:34px 0\">\n    <p style=\"font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)\">This guide is general information, not legal or security advice. Laws on adult content vary by country — check what applies where you live.</p>\n  </article>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:30px 0\"><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"/blog/spotting-fake-reviews-and-invented-ratings-in-directories/\">← Spotting fake reviews and invented…</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"/blog/support-creators-directly-and-why-leak-sites-cost-more-than-they-seem/\">Support creators directly, and why… →</a></div>\n  <section class=\"section\" style=\"padding-top:0\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\"><h2 id=\"more-vr-guides-5\">More VR guides</h2><a href=\"/blog/topic/vr/\">All →</a></div>\n    <div class=\"post-list\"><article class=\"post-card\">\n      <div class=\"tagline\"><a href=\"/blog/topic/safety/\" style=\"color:inherit\">Safety</a></div>\n      <h3><a href=\"/blog/how-to-tell-a-real-adult-site-from-a-malware-trap/\">How to tell a real adult site from a malware trap</a></h3>\n      <p>The five signals that separate a legitimate platform from a page that just wants your browser.</p>\n      <a class=\"more\" href=\"/blog/how-to-tell-a-real-adult-site-from-a-malware-trap/\">Read guide →</a>\n    </article><article class=\"post-card\">\n      <div class=\"tagline\"><a href=\"/blog/topic/guides/\" style=\"color:inherit\">Guides</a></div>\n      <h3><a href=\"/blog/free-versus-premium-what-you-are-actually-paying-for/\">Free versus premium: what you are actually paying for</a></h3>\n      <p>The real trade is not price against no-price. It is your attention against your money.</p>\n      <a class=\"more\" href=\"/blog/free-versus-premium-what-you-are-actually-paying-for/\">Read guide →</a>\n    </article><article class=\"post-card\">\n      <div class=\"tagline\"><a href=\"/blog/topic/safety/\" style=\"color:inherit\">Safety</a></div>\n      <h3><a href=\"/blog/why-free-onlyfans-links-are-almost-always-a-scam/\">Why &#x27;free OnlyFans&#x27; links are almost always a scam</a></h3>\n      <p>The search term is popular. The destinations behind it are a minefield of malware, fraud and stolen content.</p>\n      <a class=\"more\" href=\"/blog/why-free-onlyfans-links-are-almost-always-a-scam/\">Read guide →</a>\n    </article></div>\n  </section>\n</article></main>\n<footer class=\"site-foot de-foot\">\n  <div class=\"de-foot-band\"><div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"de-foot-top\">\n      <a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\"><img class=\"brand-logo\" src=\"/assets/logo.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\"><span class=\"wordmark\"><b>Dark</b><span class=\"ero\">-Ero</span></span></a>\n      <p>An independent adult-site directory. Listings go straight to the site. Scores appear only after a real review.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"de-foot-icons\">\n      <a href=\"/contact/\" aria-label=\"Contact\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"m3 7 9 6 9-6\"/></svg><span>Contact</span></a>\n      <a href=\"/blog/\" aria-label=\"Blog\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20\"/><path d=\"M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z\"/></svg><span>Blog</span></a>\n      <a href=\"/categories/\" aria-label=\"All categories\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/></svg><span>Categories</span></a>\n      <a href=\"/category/sell-feet-pics/\" aria-label=\"Feet marketplaces\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M4 16c2-6 4-9 8-9s6 3 8 9\"/><path d=\"M8 16v2M12 16v3M16 16v2\"/></svg><span>Feet marketplaces</span></a>\n      <a href=\"/submit/\" aria-label=\"Submit a site\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg><span>Submit</span></a>\n    </div>\n    <nav class=\"de-foot-links\" aria-label=\"Footer\">\n      <a href=\"/reviews/\">Reviews</a>\n      <a href=\"/best-lists/\">Best Lists</a>\n      <a href=\"/comparisons/\">Comparisons</a>\n      <a href=\"/alternatives/\">Alternatives</a>\n      <a href=\"/about/\">About</a>\n      <a href=\"/contact/\">Contact</a>\n      <a href=\"/blog/\">Blog</a>\n      <a href=\"/category/creator-platforms/\">Creator platforms</a><a href=\"/category/sell-feet-pics/\">Feet marketplaces</a>\n      <a href=\"/categories/\">All Categories</a>\n      <a href=\"/privacy/\">Privacy</a>\n      <a href=\"/terms/\">Terms</a>\n      <a href=\"/legal-2257/\">2257</a>\n      <a href=\"/dmca/\">DMCA</a>\n      <a href=\"/submit/\">Submit a site</a>\n    </nav>\n    <div class=\"de-foot-base\"><span>© 2026 Dark-Ero. Links lead to third-party sites we do not operate.</span><span class=\"age-pill\">18+ ONLY</span></div>\n  </div></div>\n</footer>\n","title":"VR Adult Content 2026: Headset Compatibility Guide","desc":"VR adult content only works on the headsets a site actually supports, and marketing claims often overshoot. Read the compatibility limits before you pay."}